namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamStandaloneInputModule {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/InputModule/DreamStandaloneInputModule.h#DreamStandaloneInputModule
    src   "Common standalone platform input, or mouse input.\n\nPresses, releases and wheel turns are queued on the player and dispatched on the player's next frame, in the\norder they arrived; moves and navigation are state the next frame reads."
    text  "通用的独立平台输入，或鼠标输入。\n\n按下、释放和滚轮转动会排队到玩家，并在玩家的下一帧按到达顺序派发；\n移动和导航则是下一帧读取的状态。"
    state machine
}

DreamStandaloneInputModule:GetMousePosition {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/InputModule/DreamStandaloneInputModule.h#DreamStandaloneInputModule:GetMousePosition
    src   "Where the mouse is on the game viewport, in its pixels -- as the viewport itself reckons it, so off the viewport\nwhenever the cursor is not on it: (-1,-1) once it has left or with no viewport at all, and the position past the\nleft or top edge while a drag the viewport captured is out there. A position off the viewport is over nothing.\nThe substituted pointer while SetOverrideMousePosition is on."
    text  "鼠标在游戏视口中的位置，以像素为单位——按视口自身的计算方式，因此只要光标不在视口上，\n该位置就在视口外：光标离开或完全没有视口时为 (-1,-1)；当视口捕获的拖拽位于视口外时，该位置会越过左边缘或上边缘。\n视口外的位置之上没有任何内容。\nSetOverrideMousePosition（重载鼠标位置）开启时为替换后的指针。"
    state machine
}

DreamStandaloneInputModule:GetTouchPointerID {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/InputModule/DreamStandaloneInputModule.h#DreamStandaloneInputModule:GetTouchPointerID
    src   "The pointer id finger InTouchID is tracked under: 100 plus the finger, so that no finger is the mouse."
    text  "手指 InTouchID 所跟踪的指针 id：100 加上该手指，因此任何手指都不是鼠标。"
    state machine
}

DreamStandaloneInputModule:InputMouseMove {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/InputModule/DreamStandaloneInputModule.h#DreamStandaloneInputModule:InputMouseMove
    src   "see \"bOverrideMousePosition\" property"
    text  "参见 \"bOverrideMousePosition\"（重载鼠标位置）属性"
    state machine
}

