    text  "用于游戏手柄或键盘导航的输入"
    state machine
}

DreamStandaloneInputModule:InputScroll {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/InputModule/DreamStandaloneInputModule.h#DreamStandaloneInputModule:InputScroll
    src   "input for scroll\n@param       InAxisValue             Use a 2d vector for scroll value. For mouse scroll just fill X&Y with mouse scroll value; For touchpad input use X for horizontal and Y for vertical.\n@param       InPointerID             Which pointer scrolled. Defaults to the mouse; a touchpad gesture bound to\n                                                     its own pointer can say so rather than scrolling whatever pointer 0 hovers."
    text  "用于滚动的输入\n@param       InAxisValue             使用二维向量表示滚动值。鼠标滚动只需用鼠标滚动值填充 X 和 Y；触摸板输入时 X 表示水平方向，Y 表示垂直方向。\n@param       InPointerID             哪个指针发生了滚动。默认为鼠标；绑定到\n                                                     自身指针的触摸板手势可以指明这一点，而不是滚动指针 0 所悬停的对象。"
    state machine
}

