DreamStandaloneInputModule:InputTouchTrigger {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/InputModule/DreamStandaloneInputModule.h#DreamStandaloneInputModule:InputTouchTrigger
    src   "input for touch press and release. InTouchID is the finger; its pointer is GetTouchPointerID(InTouchID)."
    text  "用于触摸按下和释放的输入。InTouchID 是手指；其指针为 GetTouchPointerID(InTouchID)。"
    state machine
}

DreamStandaloneInputModule:InputTrigger {
