DreamStandaloneInputModule:SetOverrideMousePosition {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/InputModule/DreamStandaloneInputModule.h#DreamStandaloneInputModule:SetOverrideMousePosition
    src   "While on, the pointer position comes from SetOverridePointerPosition rather than the OS mouse: GetMousePosition\nanswers with the override, so every caller that routes through it -- the event system actor's clicks and moves\nincluded -- follows the substituted pointer for free. This is the virtual-cursor seam."
    text  "启用后，指针位置来自 SetOverridePointerPosition 而非操作系统鼠标：GetMousePosition\n以重载后的位置作答，因此所有经由它路由的调用方——包括事件系统 Actor 的点击和移动——\n都会自动跟随替换后的指针。这是虚拟光标的接缝。"
    state machine
}

DreamStandaloneInputModule:SetOverridePointerPosition {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/InputModule/DreamStandaloneInputModule.h#DreamStandaloneInputModule:SetOverridePointerPosition
    src   "Move the substituted pointer. Pushes the position into the pointer pipeline when overriding."
    text  "移动替换后的指针。处于重载状态时，将位置推入指针管线。"
    state machine
}
